msgid "启动后，节点会将公开端口转发到指定的本地游戏端口。FRP 与游戏、服务端独立启停；令牌保存在系统安全存储中。"
msgstr "The relay forwards its public port to the local game port. FRP starts and stops independently of games and servers. Tokens use system secure storage."

msgid "启动进程不等于已进入世界。取消运行中的游戏会请求正常退出，并等待游戏结束。"
msgstr "A running process does not confirm entry into a world. Cancelling requests a normal game exit and waits for it to finish."

