msgstr "Remove game (recoverable)"

msgid "移除只隐藏游戏并保留全部文件。完整备份最多 16 GiB，包含存档、配置和安装资源；请先关闭游戏。"
msgstr "Removal hides the game and preserves its files. Full backups include saves, settings and installation files, up to 16 GiB. Close the game first."

