msgid "AmberL · 原生桌面开发预览\nAmbrum Rust 核心 / MPL-2.0\n沿用 AMBER 图形标志，青绿色为 AmberL 识别色。\nSlint 为当前界面实现，最终框架验收尚未完成。"
msgstr "AmberL · Native desktop preview\nAmbrum Rust core / MPL-2.0\nAMBER graphic mark with AmberL teal accents.\nSlint is the current UI; final framework acceptance is pending."

