msgid "可创建独立原版副本。原库只读，不直接启动或修改；隔离未知、冲突或模组加载器暂不支持导入。"
msgstr "An independent Vanilla copy is available. The source stays read-only. Unknown/conflicting isolation and modded loaders cannot be imported yet."

