msgstr "Inspection only. Unknown/conflicting isolation and modded loaders cannot be imported. Check the original launcher's settings, then rescan."

msgid "复制存档、资源包、截图和设置文件；官方游戏资源重新校验下载。不会复制账户、启动器配置或模组。总计最多 16 GiB，请先关闭来源游戏。"
